OL,3,GNEWSACentre devastated by death of 'the
OL,4,Abest of otters'
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at a wildlife centre have said
OL,7,Fthey are beyond devastated by the death
OL,8,Fof "truly the best of otters".
OL,10,FMusa, who lived at WWT Washington
OL,11,FWetland Centre, near Sunderland, died
OL,12,Fon Friday following a short illness
OL,13,Fdays after he celebrated his 17th
OL,14,Fbirthday.
OL,16,FThe Asian short-clawed otter, who had
OL,17,Ffathered nine cubs, was the oldest of
OL,18,Fhis species across the whole of the
OL,19,FWWT, the charity said.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
